msgid "Do Not Disturb during meetings"
msgstr "会議中はマナーモード"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigEvents.qml
msgid "Plasma's Do Not Disturb from the start until the end of a meeting with guests or a meeting link. Mark as Ended turns it off."
